            },
            {
                "content": "```\nInput: n = 2\nOutput: 6\nExplanation: All possible orders:\n(P1,P2,D1,D2), (P1,P2,D2,D1), (P1,D1,P2,D2), (P2,P1,D1,D2), (P2,P1,D2,D1) and (P2,D2,P1,D1).\nThis is an invalid order (P1,D2,P2,D1) because Pickup 2 is after of Delivery 2.\n```"
